{"strongs": "H7676", "word": "שַׁבָּת", "translit": "shab.bat", "root": "שבת", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "sabbath", "definition": "שַׁבָּת 111 noun feminine Exod 31:41 + and masculine Isa 66:2 ; Isa 66:6 (under influence of יוֺם in frequent ׳ יוֺם הַשּׁ , Albr ZAW xvi (1896), 47 ) sabbath ( = ת + שׁבת ; Late Hebrew שַׁבָּת , Aramaic שַׁבְּתָא , ; perhaps Assyrian šabattum (|| um nu— libbi , day of rest of heart (i.e. propitiation) [of deity]: only in lexical Tablets); compare Lotz Quaest. de hist. Sabbati, 1883 Jen ZA iv (1889), 274 ff. (doubts connection of Assyrian word with Hebrew Sabbath) Id S. S. Times, Jan. 16, 1892, 35 f. Muss-Arn JBL xi (1892), 93 Schw Idioticon 127 ; see (more recently) Jastr Amos. J. Theol. ii (1898), 332 ff. Toy TBL xviii (1899), 190 ff. Dr Hast. DB SABBATH (1902) Zim KAT 3. 592 ff.; ZMG 1904, 199 ff. [15th day of month so called] 458 ff. ); — absolute ׳ שׁ Exod 16:25 + 64 t.; construct שַׁבַּת v Exod 16:23 + 10 t.; suffix שַׁבַּתּוֺ Num 28:10 + 3 t. suffix; plural שַׁבָּתוֺת Lev 23:15 + 7 t.; construct שַׁבְּתתֹ v Lev 23:38 ; Lev 25:3 ; Lev 25:8 suffix שַׁבְּתוֺתַי Isa 56:4 +, etc.; — 1. sabbath: \\ \\ a. primitive ליהוה ׳ שׁ Exod 16:25 ( J ), Exod 20:10 = Deut 5:14 (ten words) Lev 23:3 ( P ); ׳ הַשּׁ Exod 16:29 ( J ); בַּיוֺם ׳ הַשְּׁבִיעִי שׁ Exod 16:26 ( J ); on seventh day יוֺם הַשַּׁבָּת Exod 20:8 ; Exod 20:11 = Deut 5:12 ; Deut 5:15 (ten words), so throughout; Exod 31:15 + 3 t. P , Jer 17:21 ; Ezek 46:4 ; Neh 10:32 + 9 t., + (|| new moon) Isa 1:13 ; Ezek 46:1 ; 2Kgs 4:23 ; Amos 8:5 , compare Isa 66:23 (twice in verse), also חג and מועד Hos 2:13 time of change of watch in temple 2Kgs 11:5 ; 2Kgs 11:7 ; 2Kgs 11:9 (twice in verse) = 2Chr 23:4 ; 2Chr 23:8 (twice in verse); מיסך ׳ הַשּׁ (in temple) 2Kgs 16:18 originally observed simply by abstinence from labour Exod 20:9 ; Exod 20:10 = Deut 5:12-14 ; Exod 23:12 ( E ), Exod 34:21 ( J ; Br Hex. 181-195 ). \\ \\ b. Deuteronomic reason for day is deliverance from Egypt Deut 5:15 , hence its consecration, לְקַדְּשׁוֺ v Deut 5:12 = Exod 20:8 ׳ קדּשׁ יום השׁ Jer 17:22 ; Jer 17:24 ; Jer 17:27 (especially no load carried), Ezek 20:20 ; Ezek 44:24 . \\ \\ c. intensified by anith. ׳ חלּל שׁ Ezek 20:13 +5 t. Ezekiel; compare Neh 13:18 . Phrases in H: ׳ שׁמר (ה)שׁ Lev 19:3 ; Lev 19:10 ; Lev 26:2 , then P Exod 31:13 ; Exod 31:14 ; Exod 31:16 compare Isa 56:2 ; Isa 56:4 ; Isa 56:6 יוֺם קָדְשִׁי , ׳ קדושׁ י : Isa 58:13 (twice in verse) (with כבּד ). H also שַׁבְּתֹתֵיכֶם Lev 26:35 ׳ מִמָּחֳרַת הַשּׁ Lev 23:11 ; Lev 23:15 ; Lev 23:16 שַׁבְּתוֺתַי Lev 19:3 ; Lev 19:30 ; Lev 26:2 ; Isa 56:4 ; Ezek 20:12 ; Ezek 22:26 , +8 t. Ezekiel; || מוֺעֵד Lam 2:6 . \\ \\ d. P gives as basis God's resting Exod 20:11 ; Exod 31:17 ׳ שׁבתות י Lev 23:38 קדשׁ ׳ שׁ ליהוה Exod 16:23 , compare Neh 9:14 , שׁבתון ׳ שׁ Exod 31:15 ; Exod 35:2 ; Lev 23:3 ׳ עשׂה השׁ Exod 31:16 , בְּשַׁבַּתּוֺ ׳ עֹלַת שׁ Num 28:10 , compare Isa 66:23 ׳ בְּיוֺם הַשּׁ ׳ בְּיוֺם הַשּׁ Lev 24:8 on every sabbath , abbreviation שַׁבַּת שַׁבָּת 1Chr 9:32 לַשַּׁבָּתוֺת || חֳדָשִׁים + מועדים 1Chr 23:31 + 3 t. Chronicles, Neh 10:34 ( ל omitted by error); work punished by stoning Num 15:32 ; Num 15:36 trade prohibited Neh 10:32 ; Neh 13:15-21 . 2. day of atonement is a שַׁבַּת שַׁבָּתוֺן Lev 16:31 ; Lev 23:32 ( P ), compare שָׁבַת שַׁבָּת v Lev 23:32 ( P ). 3. sabbath year , שַׁבַּת שַׁבָּתוֺן Lev 25:4 ( H ); שַׁבָּת ליהוה v Lev 25:2 v Lev 25:4 ( H ), שַׁבְּתוֺתֶיהָ רצה (הארץׅ Lev 26:34 (twice in verse); Lev 26:43 ( H ), 2Chr 36:21 . 4. = week(?) : שֶׁבַע שַׁבָּתוֺת Lev 23:15 ( H ), seven sabbaths or weeks ; שֶׁבַע שַׁבְּתתֹ (ה)שָּׁנִים Lev 25:8 ; Lev 28:8 ( H ) seven sabbaths or weeks (of years), uncertain (see Mark 16:2 ; Mark 16:9 ; Luke 18:12 ; Matt 28:1 , compare Jewish-Aramaic usage); possibly שַׁבָּת Isa 66:23 = week ( Du ). 5. שַׁבַּת הָאָ֫רֶץ Lev 25:6 ( H ) = produce in sabbath year (growing of itself).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8453')\">BDB8453</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H7676')\">H7676</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8452')\">BDB8452</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8454')\">BDB8454</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>שַׁבָּת</bdbheb><sub>111</sub> <b>noun feminine</b><sup><checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"Exod 31:41\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"41\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"41\" onclick=\"bcv(2,31,41)\">Exod 31:41</ref>+</sup> and <b>masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Isa 66:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"66\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"66\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,66,2)\">Isa 66:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 66:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"66\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"66\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,66,6)\">Isa 66:6</ref></sup> (under influence of <bdbheb>יוֺם</bdbheb> in frequent <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>יוֺם הַשּׁ</bdbheb>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Albr.')\">Albr<sup>ZAW xvi (1896), 47</sup></lookup>) <highlightword>sabbath</highlightword> ( = <bdbheb>ת</bdbheb> + <bdbheb>שׁבת</bdbheb>; Late Hebrew <bdbheb>שַׁבָּת</bdbheb>, Aramaic <bdbarc>שַׁבְּתָא</bdbarc>, <placeholder5407/>; perhaps Assyrian <transliteration><highlight>šabattum</highlight></transliteration> (||<transliteration><highlight>um nu— libbi</highlight></transliteration>, <highlight>day of rest of heart</highlight> (i.e. propitiation) [of deity]: only in lexical Tablets); compare Lotz<sup>Quaest. de hist. Sabbati, 1883</sup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Jen')\">Jen<sup>ZA iv (1889), 274 ff.</sup></lookup> (doubts connection of Assyrian word with Hebrew Sabbath) Id<sup>S. S. Times, Jan. 16, 1892, 35 f.</sup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('M-A')\">Muss-Arn<sup>JBL xi (1892), 93</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Schw')\">Schw<sup>Idioticon 127</sup></lookup>; see (more recently) <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Jastr')\">Jastr<sup>Amos. J. Theol. ii (1898), 332 ff.</sup></lookup> Toy<sup>TBL xviii (1899), 190 ff.</sup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr<sup>Hast. DB SABBATH (1902)</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Zim')\">Zim<sup>KAT 3. 592 ff.; ZMG 1904, 199 ff.</sup></lookup> [15th day of month so called]<sup>458 ff.</sup>); — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 16:25\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(2,16,25)\">Exod 16:25</ref> + 64 t.; construct <bdbheb>שַׁבַּת</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Exod 16:23\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(2,16,23)\">Exod 16:23</ref> + 10 t.; suffix <bdbheb>שַׁבַּתּוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 28:10\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(4,28,10)\">Num 28:10</ref> + 3 t. suffix; plural <bdbheb>שַׁבָּתוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 23:15\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(3,23,15)\">Lev 23:15</ref> + 7 t.; construct <bdbheb>שַׁבְּתתֹ</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Lev 23:38\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(3,23,38)\">Lev 23:38</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 25:3\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(3,25,3)\">Lev 25:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 25:8\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(3,25,8)\">Lev 25:8</ref> suffix <bdbheb>שַׁבְּתוֺתַי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 56:4\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"56\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"56\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(23,56,4)\">Isa 56:4</ref> +, etc.; — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>sabbath:</highlight> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> primitive <bdbheb>ליהוה</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 16:25\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(2,16,25)\">Exod 16:25</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Exod 20:10\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(2,20,10)\">Exod 20:10</ref> = <ref ref=\"Deut 5:14\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(5,5,14)\">Deut 5:14</ref> (ten words) <ref ref=\"Lev 23:3\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(3,23,3)\">Lev 23:3</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>); <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַשּׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 16:29\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(2,16,29)\">Exod 16:29</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>); <bdbheb>בַּיוֺם</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַשְּׁבִיעִי שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 16:26\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(2,16,26)\">Exod 16:26</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>); on seventh day <bdbheb>יוֺם הַשַּׁבָּת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 20:8\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(2,20,8)\">Exod 20:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 20:11\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(2,20,11)\">Exod 20:11</ref> = <ref ref=\"Deut 5:12\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(5,5,12)\">Deut 5:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 5:15\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(5,5,15)\">Deut 5:15</ref> (ten words), so throughout; <ref ref=\"Exod 31:15\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(2,31,15)\">Exod 31:15</ref> + 3 t. <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>, <ref ref=\"Jer 17:21\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(24,17,21)\">Jer 17:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 46:4\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(26,46,4)\">Ezek 46:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 10:32\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(16,10,32)\">Neh 10:32</ref> + 9 t., + (|| new moon) <ref ref=\"Isa 1:13\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(23,1,13)\">Isa 1:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 46:1\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"46\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"46\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(26,46,1)\">Ezek 46:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 4:23\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(12,4,23)\">2Kgs 4:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"Amos 8:5\" b=\"30\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(30,8,5)\">Amos 8:5</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Isa 66:23\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"66\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"66\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(23,66,23)\">Isa 66:23</ref> (twice in verse), also <bdbheb>חג</bdbheb> and <bdbheb>מועד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Hos 2:13\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(28,2,13)\">Hos 2:13</ref> time of change of watch in temple <ref ref=\"2Kgs 11:5\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(12,11,5)\">2Kgs 11:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 11:7\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(12,11,7)\">2Kgs 11:7</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 11:9\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(12,11,9)\">2Kgs 11:9</ref> (twice in verse) = <ref ref=\"2Chr 23:4\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(14,23,4)\">2Chr 23:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 23:8\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(14,23,8)\">2Chr 23:8</ref> (twice in verse); <bdbheb>מיסך</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַשּׁ</bdbheb> (in temple) <ref ref=\"2Kgs 16:18\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(12,16,18)\">2Kgs 16:18</ref> originally observed simply by <highlight>abstinence from labour</highlight> <ref ref=\"Exod 20:9\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(2,20,9)\">Exod 20:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 20:10\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(2,20,10)\">Exod 20:10</ref> = <ref ref=\"Deut 5:12-14\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(5,5,12)\">Deut 5:12-14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 23:12\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(2,23,12)\">Exod 23:12</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"Exod 34:21\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(2,34,21)\">Exod 34:21</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('J')\"><reflink>J</reflink></lookup>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Br')\">Br<sup>Hex. 181-195</sup></lookup>). <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> Deuteronomic reason for day is deliverance from Egypt <ref ref=\"Deut 5:15\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(5,5,15)\">Deut 5:15</ref>, hence its consecration, <bdbheb>לְקַדְּשׁוֺ</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Deut 5:12\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(5,5,12)\">Deut 5:12</ref> = <ref ref=\"Exod 20:8\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(2,20,8)\">Exod 20:8</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>קדּשׁ יום השׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Jer 17:22\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(24,17,22)\">Jer 17:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 17:24\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(24,17,24)\">Jer 17:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 17:27\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(24,17,27)\">Jer 17:27</ref> (especially no load carried), <ref ref=\"Ezek 20:20\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(26,20,20)\">Ezek 20:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 44:24\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"44\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"44\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(26,44,24)\">Ezek 44:24</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>c.</b> intensified by anith. <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>חלּל שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 20:13\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(26,20,13)\">Ezek 20:13</ref> +5 t. Ezekiel; compare <ref ref=\"Neh 13:18\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(16,13,18)\">Neh 13:18</ref>. Phrases in H: <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁמר (ה)שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 19:3\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(3,19,3)\">Lev 19:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 19:10\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(3,19,10)\">Lev 19:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 26:2\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(3,26,2)\">Lev 26:2</ref>, then <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup> <ref ref=\"Exod 31:13\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(2,31,13)\">Exod 31:13</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 31:14\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(2,31,14)\">Exod 31:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 31:16\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(2,31,16)\">Exod 31:16</ref> compare <ref ref=\"Isa 56:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"56\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"56\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,56,2)\">Isa 56:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 56:4\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"56\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"56\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(23,56,4)\">Isa 56:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 56:6\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"56\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"56\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(23,56,6)\">Isa 56:6</ref> <bdbheb>יוֺם קָדְשִׁי</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>קדושׁ י</bdbheb>: <ref ref=\"Isa 58:13\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"58\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"58\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(23,58,13)\">Isa 58:13</ref> (twice in verse) (with <bdbheb>כבּד</bdbheb>). <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('H')\"><reflink>H</reflink></lookup> also <bdbheb>שַׁבְּתֹתֵיכֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 26:35\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(3,26,35)\">Lev 26:35</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מִמָּחֳרַת הַשּׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 23:11\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(3,23,11)\">Lev 23:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 23:15\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(3,23,15)\">Lev 23:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 23:16\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(3,23,16)\">Lev 23:16</ref> <bdbheb>שַׁבְּתוֺתַי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 19:3\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(3,19,3)\">Lev 19:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 19:30\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(3,19,30)\">Lev 19:30</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 26:2\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(3,26,2)\">Lev 26:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 56:4\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"56\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"56\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(23,56,4)\">Isa 56:4</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 20:12\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(26,20,12)\">Ezek 20:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 22:26\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(26,22,26)\">Ezek 22:26</ref>, +8 t. Ezekiel; || <bdbheb>מוֺעֵד</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lam 2:6\" b=\"25\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(25,2,6)\">Lam 2:6</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>d.</b> P gives as basis God's resting <ref ref=\"Exod 20:11\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(2,20,11)\">Exod 20:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 31:17\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(2,31,17)\">Exod 31:17</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁבתות י</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 23:38\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(3,23,38)\">Lev 23:38</ref> <bdbheb>קדשׁ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>ליהוה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 16:23\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(2,16,23)\">Exod 16:23</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Neh 9:14\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(16,9,14)\">Neh 9:14</ref>, <bdbheb>שׁבתון</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 31:15\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(2,31,15)\">Exod 31:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 35:2\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(2,35,2)\">Exod 35:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 23:3\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(3,23,3)\">Lev 23:3</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עשׂה השׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 31:16\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(2,31,16)\">Exod 31:16</ref>, <bdbheb>בְּשַׁבַּתּוֺ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עֹלַת שׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 28:10\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(4,28,10)\">Num 28:10</ref>, compare <ref ref=\"Isa 66:23\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"66\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"66\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(23,66,23)\">Isa 66:23</ref> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בְּיוֺם הַשּׁ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>בְּיוֺם הַשּׁ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 24:8\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(3,24,8)\">Lev 24:8</ref> <highlight>on every sabbath</highlight>, abbreviation <bdbheb>שַׁבַּת שַׁבָּת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 9:32\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(13,9,32)\">1Chr 9:32</ref> <bdbheb>לַשַּׁבָּתוֺת</bdbheb> || <bdbheb>חֳדָשִׁים</bdbheb> + <bdbheb>מועדים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Chr 23:31\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(13,23,31)\">1Chr 23:31</ref> + 3 t. Chronicles, <ref ref=\"Neh 10:34\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(16,10,34)\">Neh 10:34</ref> (<bdbheb>ל</bdbheb> omitted by error); work punished by stoning <ref ref=\"Num 15:32\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(4,15,32)\">Num 15:32</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 15:36\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"36\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"36\" onclick=\"bcv(4,15,36)\">Num 15:36</ref> trade prohibited <ref ref=\"Neh 10:32\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(16,10,32)\">Neh 10:32</ref>; <ref ref=\"Neh 13:15-21\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(16,13,15)\">Neh 13:15-21</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>day of atonement</highlight> is a <bdbheb>שַׁבַּת שַׁבָּתוֺן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 16:31\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(3,16,31)\">Lev 16:31</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 23:32\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(3,23,32)\">Lev 23:32</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>), compare <bdbheb>שָׁבַת שַׁבָּת</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Lev 23:32\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(3,23,32)\">Lev 23:32</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> <highlight>sabbath year</highlight>, <bdbheb>שַׁבַּת שַׁבָּתוֺן</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 25:4\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(3,25,4)\">Lev 25:4</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('H')\"><reflink>H</reflink></lookup>); <bdbheb>שַׁבָּת ליהוה</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Lev 25:2\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(3,25,2)\">Lev 25:2</ref> v<ref ref=\"Lev 25:4\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(3,25,4)\">Lev 25:4</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('H')\"><reflink>H</reflink></lookup>), <bdbheb>שַׁבְּתוֺתֶיהָ רצה (הארץׅ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 26:34\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(3,26,34)\">Lev 26:34</ref> (twice in verse); <ref ref=\"Lev 26:43\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"26\" vBegin=\"43\" cEnd=\"26\" vEnd=\"43\" onclick=\"bcv(3,26,43)\">Lev 26:43</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('H')\"><reflink>H</reflink></lookup>), <ref ref=\"2Chr 36:21\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"36\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"36\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(14,36,21)\">2Chr 36:21</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> = <highlight>week(?)</highlight>: <bdbheb>שֶׁבַע שַׁבָּתוֺת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 23:15\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(3,23,15)\">Lev 23:15</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('H')\"><reflink>H</reflink></lookup>), seven <highlight>sabbaths</highlight> or <highlight>weeks</highlight>; <bdbheb>שֶׁבַע שַׁבְּתתֹ (ה)שָּׁנִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 25:8\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(3,25,8)\">Lev 25:8</ref>; <checkingNeeded/><ref ref=\"Lev 28:8\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(3,28,8)\">Lev 28:8</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('H')\"><reflink>H</reflink></lookup>) seven sabbaths or weeks (of years), uncertain (see <ref ref=\"Mark 16:2\" b=\"41\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(41,16,2)\">Mark 16:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Mark 16:9\" b=\"41\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(41,16,9)\">Mark 16:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Luke 18:12\" b=\"42\" cBegin=\"18\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"18\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(42,18,12)\">Luke 18:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Matt 28:1\" b=\"40\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(40,28,1)\">Matt 28:1</ref>, compare Jewish-Aramaic usage); possibly <bdbheb>שַׁבָּת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 66:23\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"66\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"66\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(23,66,23)\">Isa 66:23</ref> = <highlight>week</highlight> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Du')\">Du</lookup>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>5.</b> <bdbheb>שַׁבַּת הָאָ֫רֶץ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 25:6\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(3,25,6)\">Lev 25:6</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('H')\"><reflink>H</reflink></lookup>) = <highlight>produce</highlight> in sabbath year (growing of itself). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Exod 31:41", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 31, "verse": 41}, {"r